261
00:18:21.434 --> 00:18:25.701
Couldn't we just ask the
Rez police for permission?

262
00:18:25.972 --> 00:18:27.838
Yeah. good luck with that.

263
00:18:32.311 --> 00:18:34.191
Would you rather I started
