393
00:27:36.455 --> 00:27:39.789
You know. I did try to
do this the right way first.

394
00:28:28.507 --> 00:28:30.840
About what you saw earlier...

395
00:28:33.845 --> 00:28:36.337
I. uh... I didn't see anything.

396
00:28:39.518 --> 00:28:40.850
I...

397
00:28:41.019 --> 00:28:43.420
Yeah. neither did I.

398
00:28:52.164 --> 00:28:54.030
Uh. can I get a
room for tonight?

399
