470
00:32:52.771 --> 00:32:54.782
He's just been getting calls
at the station from a doctor

471
00:32:54.806 --> 00:32:55.806
and he never calls back.

472
00:32:55.974 --> 00:32:59.035
so I'm just trying to figure out
if it's 'cause he doesn't want to

473
00:32:59.211 --> 00:33:01.237
or if he's just caught
up in the Will Balint case.

474
00:33:02.214 --> 00:33:03.614
Will Balint?

475
